{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"ayelet-zurer","name":"Ayelet Zurer","birthDate":"1969-06-28","birthPlace":"Tel Aviv, Israel","bio":"Ayelet Zurer (born 28 June 1969) is an Israeli TV and film actress. She began her career on the Israeli teen drama Inyan Shel Zman and has starred in numerous Israeli TV and film roles. She received awards for Best Actress at the Israeli Academy Awards in 2003 and Best Actress by the Israeli Academy of Television in 2006 and 2013.\n\nZurer has also appeared in numerous Hollywood films, such as Munich (2005), Vantage Point (2008), Angels & Demons (2009), Man of Steel (2013), and Ben-Hur (2016). She also portrayed Vanessa Marianna-Fisk in the Marvel Cinematic Universe television series Daredevil (2015–2018) and its revival series Daredevil: Born Again (2025–present).","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T18:00:40+00:00","tmdbId":8786,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/8786","credits":[{"id":"daredevil-born-1","title":"Daredevil: Born Again — Season 1","character":"Vanessa Fisk","characterFa":"ونسا فیسک"},{"id":"daredevil-born-2","title":"Daredevil: Born Again — Season 2","character":"Vanessa Fisk","characterFa":"ونسا فیسک"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/ayelet-zurer.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Daredevil: Born Again Official Podcast","year":2026,"character":"Self - Vanessa Fisk","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pXr32DqmkiEJTQbpf9u6JRgPPzB.jpg"},{"name":"Daredevil: Born Again","year":2025,"character":"Vanessa Fisk","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xDUoAsU8lQHOOoRkFiBuarmACDN.jpg","characterFa":"ونسا فیسک"},{"name":"House of David","year":2025,"character":"Queen Ahinoam","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i4eskPIEI5sK0IibHhWqBU9Ts0k.jpg"},{"name":"The Best Worst Thing","year":2024,"character":"Dr. Amalia Levy","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eHUCRgAUfdtuFdaT7j6dLwmX1cS.jpg"},{"name":"Moonhaven","year":2022,"character":"